    {"type":"text","id":"callout_text","x":350,"y":712,"width":1180,"height":96,"text":"How it stays affordable: stations 1–5 use the careful AI model (Opus 4.7) for authoring — slow and considered.\nStations 6–7 use the fast model (Haiku 4.5) for high-volume rendering and per-item validation — quick and cheap.\nEvery stage is resumable: kill the pipeline anytime, restart, it picks up exactly where it left off.","originalText":"How it stays affordable: stations 1–5 use the careful AI model (Opus 4.7) for authoring — slow and considered.\nStations 6–7 use the fast model (Haiku 4.5) for high-volume rendering and per-item validation — quick and cheap.\nEvery stage is resumable: kill the pipeline anytime, restart, it picks up exactly where it left off.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#7c2d12","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":160002,"version":1,"versionNonce":160002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"callout","lineHeight":1.4}
